  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "31894908",
      "title": "What are (Local) Notifications?",
      "lectureOrder": 244,
      "videoOrder": 237,
      "sourceHash": "cb3b331c7db4a4c8d083dc0a0e0a22cd5aa125ca8e73856d5c7ecaf4b5c0fdf6",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.14,
          "end": 5.44,
          "en": "Now, let's start diving into Notifications.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.44,
          "end": 9.1,
          "en": "And as mentioned, we'll start with Local Notifications.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 9.1,
          "end": 10.32,
          "en": "And for that, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.32,
          "end": 11.58,
          "en": "we need to understand",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.58,
          "end": 14.98,
          "en": "what exactly Local Notifications are.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 14.98,
          "end": 16.03,
          "en": "As a side note,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 16.03,
          "end": 19.453,
          "en": "the concept behind Local Notifications",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 19.453,
          "end": 22.88,
          "en": "is also related to Push Notifications.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 22.88,
          "end": 24.45,
          "en": "So what you'll learn now",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 24.45,
          "end": 28.33,
          "en": "about Local Notifications will also help you later",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 28.33,
          "end": 30.993,
          "en": "when we dive into Push Notifications.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 31.87,
          "end": 35.36,
          "en": "Now, Local Notifications are simply Notifications",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 35.36,
          "end": 37.79,
          "en": "that are triggered by the installed app",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 37.79,
          "end": 41.3,
          "en": "on the same device on which the app is installed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 41.3,
          "end": 44.13,
          "en": "So these are Notifications that are not sent",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 44.13,
          "end": 47.04,
          "en": "to any other devices or users,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 47.04,
          "end": 49.57,
          "en": "but which are instead triggered by an app",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 49.57,
          "end": 53.43,
          "en": "for the device on which that app is installed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 53.43,
          "end": 57.91,
          "en": "And you can simply schedule such Notifications",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 57.91,
          "end": 59.5,
          "en": "from inside the app",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 59.5,
          "end": 61.67,
          "en": "and you can then also configure the delivery",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 61.67,
          "end": 64.75,
          "en": "and what should happen when such a Notification",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 64.75,
          "end": 67.28,
          "en": "is received on the device.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 67.28,
          "end": 72.28,
          "en": "And you might wonder why you need such Local Notifications,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 72.51,
          "end": 74.39,
          "en": "because whilst it makes sense",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 74.39,
          "end": 78.71000000000001,
          "en": "that you can send Notifications to other devices,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 78.71000000000001,
          "end": 81.64,
          "en": "for example, when a chat message was received,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 81.64,
          "end": 83.33,
          "en": "it might not be obvious why",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 83.33,
          "end": 87.21000000000001,
          "en": "you might wanna send Notifications to yourself.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 87.21000000000001,
          "end": 90.72,
          "en": "Well, think about apps like a reminder app",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 90.72,
          "end": 94.50999999999999,
          "en": "or maybe an alarm clock app or a to-do app.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 94.50999999999999,
          "end": 97.32,
          "en": "Of course it might not make too much sense",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 97.32,
          "end": 99.95,
          "en": "to send yourself a Notification",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 99.95,
          "end": 102.15,
          "en": "that is delivered instantly,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 102.15,
          "end": 104.77000000000001,
          "en": "but scheduling a Notification",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 104.77000000000001,
          "end": 107,
          "en": "to be delivered in the future.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 107,
          "end": 109.58,
          "en": "For example, when a to-do becomes due",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 109.58,
          "end": 112.14,
          "en": "or when a reminder becomes due,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 112.14,
          "end": 114.393,
          "en": "that might make a lot of sense.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 115.3,
          "end": 117.02000000000001,
          "en": "And this is what we'll start with.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 117.02000000000001,
          "end": 117.97,
          "en": "And as you'll see,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 117.97,
          "end": 121.55,
          "en": "adding such scheduled Local Notifications",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 121.55,
          "end": 124.61,
          "en": "is really straightforward with React Native,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 124.61,
          "end": 126.703,
          "en": "especially when using Expo.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
